s/dw/20251030/1060579801238343680237406.jpeg/pXpop95n8mfxFpvatRH4dFNIRyjv1i5UEzXxYhM18WI\"/><figcaption>最近日本多地接連發生熊闖入學校的驚險事件，讓不少人心驚膽戰，也引發網友熱烈討論。（YouTube@ntv_news）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"最近日本多地接連發生熊闖入學校的驚險事件，讓不少人心驚膽戰，也引發網友熱烈討論。（YouTube@ntv_news）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251030/1060579803536953344410573.jpeg/auQPgyAB6kiH9MUDIxqkxwq0dyCQxoE9dsM6QXbDOkE\"/><figcaption>最近日本多地接連發生熊闖入學校的驚險事件，讓不少人心驚膽戰，也引發網友熱烈討論。（YouTube@ntv_news）</figcaption></figure><p>北海道熊「1招破解電網」鑽進農田　小熊全看在眼裡學起來了</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T03:22:18.405133+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1776,"images":19,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T03:00:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T05:37:26.722154+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T03:15:46.558500+00:00","content_hash":"cb4ba5f5b733c480c654fb985d4c87a2938e867a5e3a98477a8ec33ee0a94d9f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}